# Temperance Remade's ice-core store (CIPlay temperance_remade_cave, 11-12 w13; in a test world 'CI ...'; PASS 11-16 w13B;
# 11-17 w13: now a level adit dug into a snow knoll).
# Points as in its recipe: the new pad at 74 -38 (r 28, 3 m), the bridge from the old pad at
# 44..54 -38, the knoll at 76 -38 (b 12, h 14), the adit's mouth at 62.5 -38 (kit_dig yaw 90, room 73.5..78.5), the sign
# at 53 -30, the weather team's chest at 77 -39.5 in the room. Floor ~2 (dug level under the pad).
island Temperance Remade keep
offset 1.817 -12.2534
hour 11
weather Calm

picture te_ice_out 48 6 -26 62.5 3 -38
read ICE-CORE STORE
walk 46 -39 to 54 -38.5 to 60 -38 to 66 -38 to 72 -38 to 75.5 -38.5 below=8
picture te_ice_in 67 3.5 -38 77 2.5 -39 light=20
open Ice-core chest
wait 2
expect item Battery 1
walk 75.5 -38.5 to 72 -38 to 66 -38 to 60 -38 to 52 -38.5 to 46 -39 below=8
picture te_ice_mouth 40 5 -34 62.5 3.5 -38
picture te_ice_mouth_q 46 6 -48 62.5 3.5 -38
picture te_ice_mouth_n 46 6 -28 62.5 3.5 -38
